  "title": "Kemper Reports First Quarter 2026 Operating Results*",
  "summary": "Kemper Corporation (NYSE: KMPR) reported a net loss of $1.7 million, or $(0.03) per share, for the first quarter of 2026, compared to net income of $99.7 million, or $1.54 per diluted share, for the first quarter of 2025. Adjusted Consolidated Net Operating Income 1 was $12.5 million, or $0.21 per share, for the first quarter of 2026, compared to Adjusted Consolidated Net Operating Income 1 of $106.4 million, or $1.65 per diluted share, for the first quarter of 2025. Summary of quarterly perform",
